1
00:00:09,277 --> 00:00:11,927
=The Glory Fades 2=

2
00:00:11,927 --> 00:00:13,798
=Episode 14=

3
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:15,521
What's the point of all this?

4
00:00:15,640 --> 00:00:17,160
It serves our common goal

5
00:00:18,001 --> 00:00:19,001
of bringing Nie Feng down.

6
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:28,920
You...

7
00:00:31,961 --> 00:00:32,961
I get it.

8
00:00:33,641 --> 00:00:35,201
You're playing the martyr

9
00:00:35,481 --> 00:00:38,481
to get the evidence from me for him.

10
00:00:38,481 --> 00:00:39,481
Right?

11
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:44,361
If Nie Feng becomes a speaker,

12
00:00:45,760 --> 00:00:47,080
it would all be over.

13
00:00:52,881 --> 00:00:53,881
It'd all be over?

14
00:00:56,321 --> 00:00:57,321
Have some grapes.

15
00:01:11,400 --> 00:01:12,961
If you doubt I can get the evidence

16
00:01:12,961 --> 00:01:14,000
out of Sea Breeze,

17
00:01:14,920 --> 00:01:15,961
please trust me.

18
00:01:16,721 --> 00:01:17,760
I'll find a way.

19
00:01:35,560 --> 00:01:36,560
You just

20
00:01:37,120 --> 00:01:38,200
never listen.

21
00:01:39,120 --> 00:01:40,760
I said I didn't need your help.

22
00:01:41,721 --> 00:01:42,721
See?

23
00:01:43,721 --> 00:01:44,881
Here's trouble.

24
00:01:44,881 --> 00:01:45,881
I have to help.

25
00:01:46,521 --> 00:01:48,000
I owe you my life.

26
00:01:51,681 --> 00:01:52,681
Do you trust him?

27
00:01:53,886 --> 00:01:54,923
Yes, I do.

28
00:01:54,923 --> 00:01:56,120
Are you sure to help him?

29
00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:57,120
Yeah.

30
00:01:57,881 --> 00:01:59,721
On the day you saved me,

31
00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:01,480
I swore

32
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:05,120
I'd make Nie Feng pay.

33
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:13,560
Tang...

34
00:02:13,560 --> 00:02:14,721
Warden Tang,

35
00:02:14,920 --> 00:02:17,121
you've really let me down lately.

36
00:02:17,841 --> 00:02:19,080
I've failed you, sir.

37
00:02:19,721 --> 00:02:21,360
I accept your punishment.

38
00:02:21,721 --> 00:02:22,881
Do you have any idea

39
00:02:23,480 --> 00:02:25,680
how many people have reported you?

40
00:02:26,200 --> 00:02:27,321
I'm the one

41
00:02:27,321 --> 00:02:28,800
covering for you.

42
00:02:30,161 --> 00:02:33,721
Do you know how many people
covet your post?

43
00:02:33,721 --> 00:02:35,200
I'm the one

44
00:02:35,561 --> 00:02:37,520
shielding you.

45
00:02:37,920 --> 00:02:38,920
I understand

46
00:02:39,041 --> 00:02:40,401
and I'm truly grateful.

47
00:02:45,721 --> 00:02:46,721
Tang.

48
00:02:53,161 --> 00:02:54,601
This is my final warning.

49
00:02:55,401 --> 00:02:58,080
Don't you dare play both sides with me.

50
00:02:58,800 --> 00:03:00,161
Keep a close eye on Tu Jiasheng

51
00:03:00,480 --> 00:03:01,561
and Old Ghost.

52
00:03:02,161 --> 00:03:03,480
If anything happens,

53
00:03:04,281 --> 00:03:05,680
report to me immediately.

54
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:07,881
Rest assured, Mr. Nie.
I'll watch them closely.

55
00:03:08,321 --> 00:03:09,601
Nothing will go wrong.

56
00:03:32,080 --> 00:03:33,080
Your Highness,

57
00:03:33,800 --> 00:03:34,960
Nie Feng must have figured out

58
00:03:34,960 --> 00:03:36,800
why Tu Jiasheng went to Sea Breeze.

59
00:03:36,920 --> 00:03:38,520
He went to see Tu Jiasheng in person.

60
00:03:42,041 --> 00:03:43,161
When branches

61
00:03:43,640 --> 00:03:44,721
grow crooked,

62
00:03:45,121 --> 00:03:46,360
they must be pruned.

63
00:03:46,680 --> 00:03:47,721
What do you mean?

64
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:50,001
Nothing much.

65
00:03:54,001 --> 00:03:55,001
Oh, right.

66
00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:56,161
Didn't Tang Niansen

67
00:03:56,800 --> 00:03:58,001
just step down as ASEAN's

68
00:03:58,001 --> 00:03:59,401
Economic and Trade Secretary?

69
00:04:00,640 --> 00:04:01,698
That's right.

70
00:04:01,698 --> 00:04:03,001
Pay him a visit for me.

71
00:04:03,480 --> 00:04:04,760
Thank him for his hard work.

72
00:04:05,080 --> 00:04:06,721
And tell him to run for speaker

73
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:08,800
if he still wants to serve the country.

74
00:04:09,401 --> 00:04:10,401
Understood.

75
00:04:10,920 --> 00:04:13,321
Keep a close watch on Sea Breeze, too.

76
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:15,881
Nie Feng is losing it.

77
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:18,520
Looks like Tu Jiasheng is making it.

78
00:04:20,321 --> 00:04:22,561
Pull up Xia Yuyan's file for me.

79
00:04:22,561 --> 00:04:24,480
I need to know everything about her.

80
00:04:24,480 --> 00:04:26,320
Feng, what happened?

81
00:04:26,521 --> 00:04:28,680
She was looking at me

82
00:04:29,480 --> 00:04:31,281
as if she wanted to kill me.

83
00:04:31,880 --> 00:04:32,880
That can't be true.

84
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:34,721
You sent Jia Long to kill her.

85
00:04:34,800 --> 00:04:36,161
She has a reason to hate you.

86
00:04:36,281 --> 00:04:37,281
No, this is different.

87
00:04:38,281 --> 00:04:39,281
She looked at me

88
00:04:39,440 --> 00:04:42,081
as if we had a blood feud
that could never be settled.

89
00:04:42,201 --> 00:04:43,360
I must find out

90
00:04:43,440 --> 00:04:44,521
if she's related

91
00:04:44,721 --> 00:04:45,761
to Old Ghost

92
00:04:46,761 --> 00:04:48,360
or to Yuge Village.

93
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:50,320
Alright, I'll look into it.

94
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:53,000
Feng,

95
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:54,120
look.

96
00:04:57,920 --> 00:04:58,920
(As the ancients said,)

97
00:04:59,161 --> 00:05:00,320
("He who governs by virtue)

98
00:05:00,320 --> 00:05:01,320
(is like the polestar,)

99
00:05:01,521 --> 00:05:03,560
(which keeps its place
and all the stars turn towards it.")

100
00:05:04,281 --> 00:05:06,841
(Traveling around
and managing regional economic affairs)

101
00:05:06,841 --> 00:05:07,961
(in ASEAN for years,)

102
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:10,000
(I've gathered rich experience.)

103
00:05:10,240 --> 00:05:11,800
(I am willing to step up)

104
00:05:12,081 --> 00:05:13,920
(and do my utmost for the people)

105
00:05:14,081 --> 00:05:15,281
(of this land.)

106
00:05:15,680 --> 00:05:18,081
(Mr. Nie Feng
currently holds high poll numbers)

107
00:05:18,081 --> 00:05:20,281
(and is considered
the front-runner in this election.)

108
00:05:20,281 --> 00:05:21,641
(What are your thoughts on that?)

109
00:05:21,641 --> 00:05:23,761
(Polls show the trend,
not the final outcome.)

110
00:05:24,120 --> 00:05:25,320
(Mr. Nie is young and capable.)

111
00:05:25,320 --> 00:05:26,920
(I respect his achievements.)

112
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:28,920
(I have no desire
to compete with anyone.)

113
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:30,401
(I only wish to)

114
00:05:30,401 --> 00:05:32,560
(offer our people
a more trustworthy option.)

115
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:36,000
Feng,

116
00:05:36,041 --> 00:05:37,521
who gave him the nerve

117
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:38,560
to run against you?

118
00:05:39,841 --> 00:05:40,841
Who do you think?

119
00:05:41,641 --> 00:05:42,641
Who else would dare

120
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:44,560
besides the Grand Princess?

121
00:05:46,161 --> 00:05:49,081
She still doesn't trust us.

122
00:05:50,721 --> 00:05:53,201
I bet she's the one who sent Tu Jiasheng

123
00:05:53,680 --> 00:05:54,920
to Old Ghost.

124
00:05:57,201 --> 00:05:58,281
Anyway,

125
00:05:58,920 --> 00:06:00,320
whatever Old Ghost is holding

126
00:06:01,081 --> 00:06:02,800
can't end up in anyone else's hands.

127
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:04,800
Uncle Ghost is still

128
00:06:05,440 --> 00:06:06,680
waiting for your reply.

129
00:06:12,161 --> 00:06:13,761
I've almost figured out a plan.

130
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:15,120
It's taking shape.

131
00:06:15,401 --> 00:06:17,761
But I need you to do me a favor.

132
00:06:18,161 --> 00:06:19,920
Find Zhao Lu and send him abroad.

133
00:06:20,521 --> 00:06:21,601
I'll arrange the plane.

134
00:06:22,920 --> 00:06:24,081
I dragged him into this.

135
00:06:24,841 --> 00:06:26,480
I can only take on Nie Feng

136
00:06:27,081 --> 00:06:28,560
when Zhao Lu's safe.

137
00:06:32,401 --> 00:06:33,480
A message came

138
00:06:33,761 --> 00:06:35,680
that Nie Feng
is looking into the orphanage.

139
00:06:36,401 --> 00:06:37,800
They're on to me now.

140
00:06:40,081 --> 00:06:41,360
That was fast.

141
00:06:43,560 --> 00:06:45,081
I told you.

142
00:06:46,041 --> 00:06:47,401
Revenge won't come easy.

143
00:06:48,161 --> 00:06:49,880
If Nie Feng finds out

144
00:06:50,240 --> 00:06:52,560
about your ties to Captain Xia
and the Yuge Village,

145
00:06:53,081 --> 00:06:54,440
he will stop probing

146
00:06:54,440 --> 00:06:55,761
and take action immediately.

147
00:07:00,161 --> 00:07:01,560
We can't wait any longer.

148
00:07:04,320 --> 00:07:05,521
Give it to him.

149
00:07:11,120 --> 00:07:12,601
So you've had it on you all along.

150
00:07:13,041 --> 00:07:14,161
It's just a key.

151
00:07:15,161 --> 00:07:16,161
Where's the door?

152
00:07:16,320 --> 00:07:17,320
It's here.

153
00:07:20,041 --> 00:07:21,560
Whether you can find it

154
00:07:22,081 --> 00:07:23,201
depends on your ability.

155
00:07:37,320 --> 00:07:38,560
Look closely.

156
00:07:58,680 --> 00:08:00,281
If it isn't a chess manual,

157
00:08:00,721 --> 00:08:01,721
but a map,

158
00:08:02,081 --> 00:08:04,041
with the lines
as latitude and longitude,

159
00:08:04,041 --> 00:08:05,320
then each intersection

160
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:07,320
is a geographic coordinate.

161
00:08:08,880 --> 00:08:09,880
Not bad.

162
00:08:11,320 --> 00:08:13,120
Back then, Nie Feng studied this manual

163
00:08:13,120 --> 00:08:14,480
for quite a while,

164
00:08:14,680 --> 00:08:16,000
and saw nothing.

165
00:08:18,281 --> 00:08:20,201
But a grid of nineteen by nineteen lines

166
00:08:20,721 --> 00:08:21,800
is not enough.

167
00:08:22,041 --> 00:08:24,521
Overlay it on the map
of Celestial Duchy,

168
00:08:24,601 --> 00:08:25,880
and it all makes sense.

169
00:08:28,521 --> 00:08:29,880
Get the map.

170
00:08:31,161 --> 00:08:32,161
Okay.

171
00:08:56,881 --> 00:08:58,281
Latitude 23°27' N,

172
00:08:58,281 --> 00:09:00,080
longitude 98°31' E.

173
00:09:00,560 --> 00:09:02,560
Sixty kilometers north of Yuge Village.

174
00:09:02,960 --> 00:09:05,401
The evidence of Nie Feng's murders
is right there.

175
00:09:07,161 --> 00:09:08,161
Thank you.

176
00:09:15,600 --> 00:09:16,680
I'm counting on you.

177
00:09:24,041 --> 00:09:25,481
Be careful out there.

178
00:09:27,521 --> 00:09:29,080
Take care of Yuyan for me.

179
00:09:37,161 --> 00:09:38,161
Go on.

180
00:09:39,761 --> 00:09:40,761
Take care.

181
00:09:58,641 --> 00:09:59,641
Be careful.

182
00:10:01,560 --> 00:10:02,560
Don't worry.

183
00:10:29,440 --> 00:10:30,440
Come in.

184
00:10:33,361 --> 00:10:34,361
Warden,

185
00:10:35,121 --> 00:10:36,521
Mr. Tu insists on seeing you.

186
00:10:41,641 --> 00:10:42,641
Tu Jiasheng,

187
00:10:42,881 --> 00:10:44,161
what do you want again?

188
00:10:44,320 --> 00:10:45,960
Can't you just stay down?

189
00:10:46,121 --> 00:10:47,800
Nie Feng is quite upset.

190
00:10:47,800 --> 00:10:49,761
Can you please stop causing me trouble?

191
00:10:53,200 --> 00:10:54,200
I've gotten

192
00:10:56,080 --> 00:10:57,200
Old Ghost's item.

193
00:11:01,401 --> 00:11:02,481
Really?

194
00:11:04,281 --> 00:11:05,281
If he wants it,

195
00:11:06,121 --> 00:11:07,161
have him come see me.

196
00:11:19,001 --> 00:11:20,320
I see.

197
00:11:24,960 --> 00:11:25,960
Hello?

198
00:11:28,481 --> 00:11:29,560
My dear brother

199
00:11:29,761 --> 00:11:31,761
never fails to surprise me.

200
00:11:33,121 --> 00:11:34,161
Alright, I see.

201
00:11:34,481 --> 00:11:35,560
I'm on my way.

202
00:11:38,320 --> 00:11:39,960
Feng, I'll go with you.

203
00:11:40,761 --> 00:11:41,761
No need.

204
00:11:42,401 --> 00:11:43,720
Just hand me a gun.

205
00:11:56,840 --> 00:11:57,840
Feng.

206
00:12:03,720 --> 00:12:04,720
Where is it?

207
00:12:19,720 --> 00:12:20,881
I have the key.

208
00:12:21,680 --> 00:12:22,761
Where's the door?

209
00:12:28,121 --> 00:12:29,960
Handing over half and keeping half?

210
00:12:30,680 --> 00:12:32,320
That's not how we do business.

211
00:12:33,281 --> 00:12:35,200
If I gave you everything,
I'd have no leverage left.

212
00:12:35,200 --> 00:12:36,720
You never had any.

213
00:12:38,121 --> 00:12:40,800
Did you forget Lu's arrest warrant?

214
00:12:40,960 --> 00:12:41,960
Feng,

215
00:12:42,641 --> 00:12:43,720
does your warrant

216
00:12:44,001 --> 00:12:45,320
apply outside our borders?

217
00:12:47,881 --> 00:12:50,080
I've run Prosperity for years.

218
00:12:50,281 --> 00:12:52,320
Arranging a flight to get someone out

219
00:12:52,521 --> 00:12:53,560
is child's play.

220
00:12:59,680 --> 00:13:00,800
You think sending Lu away

221
00:13:00,800 --> 00:13:02,080
means I can't get to you?

222
00:13:23,296 --> 00:13:26,912
♪Streetlights stretch shadows long♪

223
00:13:27,282 --> 00:13:31,267
♪As crowds fade,
who lingers on the edge♪

224
00:13:36,023 --> 00:13:39,342
♪Guarding all those unfinished lies♪

225
00:13:39,342 --> 00:13:44,427
♪Wind sweeps through the empty harbor♪

226
00:13:48,016 --> 00:13:54,568
♪Time quietly strips away the madness♪

227
00:13:54,568 --> 00:14:02,989
♪Plunging all passion
into freezing cold♪

228
00:14:02,989 --> 00:14:06,218
♪The feast ends, leaving only emptiness♪

229
00:14:06,218 --> 00:14:09,413
♪The past drifts far away, unstoppable♪

230
00:14:09,413 --> 00:14:12,106
♪If regret is an inescapable wandering♪

231
00:14:12,106 --> 00:14:16,723
♪I swallow the silence, burning alone♪

232
00:14:20,634 --> 00:14:23,123
♪Burning alone♪

233
00:14:28,629 --> 00:14:34,998
♪The glory fades♪
